# Store every file byte-for-byte: no CRLF/LF translation, ever.
#
# This repo is a restore point for a game mod, not a source tree. Binaries and
# extensionless files are expected, and a line-ending rewrite on the wrong file
# produces a mod that builds and then misbehaves in game for no visible reason.
# Checking out any commit must give back exactly what was committed.
* -text